  ## Pitfalls

  • Sums overflow  int  quickly: N = 2 × 10⁵ values up to 10⁹
  reach 2 × 10¹⁴. Use  long long .
  • Off by one: with 1-indexed p, the range [l, r] is pᵣ - pₗ₋₁.

